@startuml
title Web UI Scenario: Load a Named Grid File from grids/

actor Player
participant "Web UI page" as WebUI
participant "Flask HTTP Request Handler" as Handler
participant "Flask Grid File I/O" as Files
participant "File System (grids/ folder)" as FS
participant "Flask Engine Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Game Engine Text Codec" as Codec
participant "Flask Page Renderer" as Renderer

autonumber

Player -> WebUI: enter file name and request load
WebUI -> Handler: HTTP load request with file name
Handler -> Files: read named grid file from grids/
Files -> FS: read plain text file in grids/
FS --> Files: grid text
Files --> Handler: grid text
Handler -> Adapter: validate grid text
Adapter -> Codec: parse grid text
Codec --> Adapter: in-memory grid or invalid-grid error
Adapter --> Handler: validation result
Handler -> Renderer: render page with grid or error
Renderer --> WebUI: HTTP response with page
WebUI -> WebUI: store returned grid text as current grid
WebUI --> Player: shows grid or clear error message
@enduml
